<h1>Capture Plane</h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p class="Description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> Capture Plane allows a datum plane to be captured using the localiser probe or to be extracted by scanning using the sensor. It is used to build datum alignments from point, line, and plane (from single plane, or from three planes) It is also useful for measuring flatness of surfaces. This command is accessible from the <i style="font-style:normal;">Localiser Menu Datum &gt; Plane</i>.</p>
<h2><span lang="EN-GB"><span lang="EN-US">W</span>izard</span></h2>
<p><span lang="EN-US">When you select</span> <span class="Path">Datum &gt; Plane</span> <span lang="EN-US">from the localiser menu the wizard behaves depending on the settings in <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Capture_Method.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Capture Method (Datum Capture Method)</a> dialog. If Plane listbox is set to</span> <span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Prompt</b></span> <span lang="EN-US">the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_method.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<p><span lang="EN-US">At this stage there are offered 2 possibilities for measuring the plane:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select<span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span>, you will capture the plane using the localiser probe. See <a href="#Capture_Plane_Wizard">Capture Plane Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet">
<p class="bullet">If you select <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span>, you will scan the plane using the sensor. See <a href="#Scan_Plane_Wizard">Scan Plane Wizard</a>.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-US"><a name="Capture_Plane_Wizard"></a>Capture Plane Wizard</span></h3>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-style:normal;">Tactile</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected</span><span lang="EN-GB">, the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_define_plane.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button at least three times to collect the necessary points. Hold</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to delete the last captured point if necessary. Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to finish.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If Tolerance check is enabled and the next point is out-of-tolerance KUBE will play warning sound and will display out-of-tolerance value in yellow. See <a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Form_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Form Tolerances</a> for details.</span></p>
<p class="Warning">A plane cannot be created if less than three points are captured. In this case a warning message will appear.</p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Direction of the plane normal is automatically calculated based on the orientation of the last axis.</span></p>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If the ball probe is used, it will offset the plane with the radius of the probe at the proper direction. This is very important for the correct location of the plane because every localiser returns co-ordinates of the centre of its probe.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a3" style="text-decoration:underline;">Scheme</a></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP163995127" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Alignment/image038.gif" width="337px" height="198px" border="0" class="img_whs5" alt=""></p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">If more than three points are captured, KUBE will fit a plane from the set of the captured points, otherwise the three points will be used to construct the plane. The following information about the resulting plane will be displayed:</span></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the normal of the plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the offset, which is the distance between the centre of the co-ordinate system and centre of the plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the RMS of the fitting (RMS will be zero if you captured three points only).</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP160330692" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/capture_plane_3.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting plane or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it as datum entity. Scanned data are automatically deleted.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the capture procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue capturing planes.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a2" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP160195795" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tactile</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Bullet">&#160;</p>
<h3><span lang="EN-GB"><a name="Scan_Plane_Wizard"></a>Scan</span> <span lang="EN-US">Plane Wizard</span></h3>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">When</span> <span lang="EN-GB" class="Path" style="font-style:normal;">Scanning</span> <span class="Path" style="font-style:normal; font-weight:normal;">is selected</span><span lang="EN-GB">, an additional window (which displays the scanned data) will pop-up and the following dialogue will appear:</span></p>
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_plane.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to start scanning. Scanning is performed as in the normal</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Scan</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode, i.e. after you press</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'B'</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">button KUBE starts capturing a patch and after you press it again KUBE will stop scanning and will enter in</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="text-decoration:underline;"><u>Pause</u></span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a7" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP159249416" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_plane1.gif" width="1152px" height="834px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">W</span>hen done with the scanning press <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>'A'</b></span> button to exit.</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p>If the extraction is successful you will get:</p>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the normal of the plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the offset, which is the distance between the centre of the co-ordinate system and centre of the plane.</span></p>
</li>
<li style="font-weight:normal;" class="kadov-p-Cbullet-circle">
<p class="bullet-circle"><span lang="EN-GB">the RMS of the extraction.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p class="Note" id="p3"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: Plane detection is controlled by <span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Tolerance</b></span> parameter. See <span lang="EN-GB"><a href="../../References/Preferences_-_Datums_-_Detection_Tolerances.htm">System &gt; Preferences &gt; Datums &gt; Detection Tolerances</a></span> <span lang="EN-GB">for details.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a5" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP159391423" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/scan_plane2.gif" width="1152px" height="834px" border="0" class="img_whs6" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to reject the resulting plane or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to create it.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">After finishing the scan procedure, KUBE will issue a dialog, asking you if you will continue scanning planes.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a6" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP159090606" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<p><img src="../Capture_files/continue.gif" width="766px" height="150px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="kadov-p-CBullet">
<p class="Bullet"><span lang="EN-GB">Press '</span><span class="Button">A'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to exit the capture mode or '</span><span class="Button">B'</span> <span lang="EN-GB">button to continue capturing using</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Scanning</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">method.</span></p>
</li>
</ul>
